        {
          "id": "d03-s8-outlook",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Looking ahead to Q4 2025, management expects a return to hiring in engineering and customer success. Capital expenditure for Q4 2025 is budgeted at $15.4M, the majority allocated to data-centre capacity and network hardware.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 97.4
